{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想隨時剪片卻不想把作品上傳雲端？ClipPro 是一款完全離線運作的影片、相片與拼貼編輯工具，適合注重私隱的創作者、YouTuber 及需要快速處理短片的用家。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>真實時間軸剪輯與電影調色</h2>\n<p>ClipPro 以同一引擎負責預覽與算圖，剪輯時看到的調色、裁切、標題與轉場，正是輸出檔案裡的實際效果。內建真正時間軸，支援多段剪輯、分割、合併、變速與凍結畫面，並提供十六種電影感調色、字體與貼圖，亦可加入音樂與旁白。匯出可選 720p 至 4K、24 至 60 fps，以及 MP4、MOV 或 GIF，全部在裝置本機完成，無需帳戶、廣告或訂閱，也不必連線。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-123-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-124-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-125-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-126-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-127-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-128-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：ClipPro: Video &amp; Photo Editor</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-08T13:39:21.744722+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":362,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}